escription":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-10-07T23:32:17Z","updated_at":"2025-12-11T00:18:17Z","closed_at":"2025-12-11T00:17:10Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nTested and reproducible in 4.5 stable, 4.5.1-rc and 4.4.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6070) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10750H CPU @ 2.60GHz (12 threads) - 63.86 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf one uses `ResourceLoader.get_threaded_request` with this specific configuration:\n- Passing `ResourceLoader.CACHE_MODE_IGNORE`\n- Loading resources that have external resources, and the external resources themselves\n\nIt may result in the corresponding `load_threaded_get` returning null resources under very specific timings.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe specific configuration and timing is quite obscure, so if you wish to reproduce, try running the MRP.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[load_threaded_get_status_3.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22755617/load_threaded_get_status_3.zip)\n\nRun the project and press the big button, then take a look at the logs. I load several images and scenes through the threaded API. I would expect that `load_threaded_get` always returns a non-null resource, but instead it returns null for many of the images (lines beginning with `actual:` list a null object).\n\nYou may have to adjust the `time_waste` variable based on the timings of your CPU. While the `time_waste` variable may seem spurious (who is waiting so long between calls of `get_threaded_request`?), it is meant to simulate a real condition. In our large project, we load many hundreds of assets through the threaded request call, so the time spent between individual calls of `get_threaded_request` can end up being non-negligible.\n\nFor more information on the specific timings exhibited, [see this pull request](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111387).","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"ht